<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>最新款智能手机种草</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        :root { --bg-color: #f8fafc; --primary-vibe: #333333; --radius: 8px; --spacing: 12px; --shadow-vibe: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) }
        body { background-color: var(--bg-color); margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
        .mobile-viewport {
            width: 100%; max-width: 420px; min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            box-shadow: 0 40px 120px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px;
            padding-bottom: 100px; position: relative;
        }
        .scrollbar-hide::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        [data-comp-id]:hover { outline: 2px dashed #ff2442; outline-offset: -2px; cursor: pointer; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="mobile-viewport">
        <div id="title_1" data-comp-id="title_1" class="px-6 mt-4 "><h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">华为Mate 60</h1></div>
        <div id="vs_card_1" data-comp-id="vs_card_1" class="mx-4 mt-2 ">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 px-1">
                <span class="w-1 h-3 bg-rose-500 rounded-full"></span>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest">华为Mate 60 vs 竞品智能手机</span>
            </div>
            <div class="relative h-44 rounded-[28px] overflow-hidden flex shadow-xl border border-white/20">
                <div class="w-1/2 bg-rose-500 p-5 flex flex-col justify-center text-white">
                    <div class="text-[8px] font-bold opacity-60 mb-1">PROS</div>
                    <div class="text-[13px] font-black leading-snug line-clamp-4">华为Mate 60搭载HarmonyOS 4.0和7nm芯片，抗跌性能提升100%， redefining high-end phone standards.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-1/2 bg-zinc-900 p-5 flex flex-col justify-center text-right text-zinc-400 border-l border-white/5">
                    <div class="text-[8px] font-bold opacity-40 mb-1">CONS</div>
                    <div class="text-[13px] font-black leading-snug line-clamp-4">某些品牌的性能已落后华为Mate 60两年，影响用户体验。</div>
                </div>
                <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-9 h-9 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-2xl z-10 border-4 border-zinc-100 font-black italic text-[10px] text-zinc-900">VS</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="story_text_1" data-comp-id="story_text_1" class="px-6 "><p class="mb-4 text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed tracking-wide">在选择智能手机的过程中，我经历了许多痛点。</p><p class="mb-4 text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed tracking-wide">无论是性能不足，还是拍照效果不佳，都是我曾经的烦恼。</p><p class="mb-4 text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed tracking-wide">但当我发现华为Mate 60时，这些问题似乎都迎刃而解。</p><p class="mb-4 text-[15px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed tracking-wide">它的强大性能和出色的拍照功能让我感受到前所未有的满足。</p></div><div id="tag_list_1" data-comp-id="tag_list_1" class="px-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 "><span class="text-blue-600 bg-blue-50/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold border border-blue-100/50"># 华为</span><span class="text-blue-600 bg-blue-50/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold border border-blue-100/50"># Mate 60</span><span class="text-blue-600 bg-blue-50/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold border border-blue-100/50"># 手机</span><span class="text-blue-600 bg-blue-50/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold border border-blue-100/50"># 科技</span></div>
    </div>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('click', e => {
            const comp = e.target.closest('[data-comp-id]');
            if (comp) window.parent.postMessage({ type: 'SELECT_REGION', id: comp.dataset.compId }, '*');
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>